title: "mcp-zenodo"
abstract: "A Zenodo MCP server: it connects large language models to Zenodo, the CERN-hosted open-access research repository, through the Model Context Protocol (MCP), exposing search, metadata, citation, and file retrieval as LLM-callable tools."
